# Classes
hpc:JobInfo a owl:Class .
hpc:SlurmJobInfo a owl:Class, rdfs:subClassOf [ hpc:JobInfo ] .
hpc:SlurmJob a owl:Class, rdfs:subClassOf [ hpc:JobInfo ] .

# Object Properties
hpc:hasJobID a owl:ObjectProperty .
hpc:hasContainer a owl:ObjectProperty .
hpc:hasCluster a owl:ObjectProperty .
hpc:hasStdinExpanded a owl:ObjectProperty .

# Datatype Properties
hpc:hasLastBackfill a owl:DatatypeProperty .
hpc:hasClusterName a owl:DatatypeProperty .
hpc:hasRelease a owl:DatatypeProperty .
hpc:hasVersion a owl:DatatypeProperty .
hpc:hasVersionMajor a owl:DatatypeProperty .
hpc:hasVersionMinor a owl:DatatypeProperty .
hpc:hasVersionMicro a owl:DatatypeProperty .
hpc:hasPluginAccountingStorage a owl:DatatypeProperty .
hpc:hasPluginName a owl:DatatypeProperty .
hpc:hasPluginType a owl:DatatypeProperty .
hpc:hasPluginDataParser a owl:DatatypeProperty .
hpc:hasClientSource a owl:DatatypeProperty .
hpc:hasClientUser a owl:DatatypeProperty .
hpc:hasClientGroup a owl:DatatypeProperty .
hpc:hasCommand a owl:DatatypeProperty .

# Domain and Range
rdfs:domain hpc:hasJobID [ hpc:SlurmJobInfo ] .
rdfs:domain hpc:hasContainer [ hpc:SlurmJob ] .
rdfs:domain hpc:hasCluster [ hpc:SlurmJob ] .
rdfs:domain hpc:hasStdinExpanded [ hpc:SlurmJob ] .
rdfs:domain hpc:hasLastBackfill [ hpc:SlurmJobInfo ] .
rdfs:domain hpc:hasClusterName [ hpc:SlurmJobInfo ] .
rdfs:domain hpc:hasRelease [ hpc:SlurmJobInfo ] .
rdfs:domain hpc:hasVersion [ hpc:SlurmJobInfo ] .
rdfs:domain hpc:hasVersionMajor [ hpc:SlurmJobInfo ] .
rdfs:domain hpc:hasVersionMinor [ hpc:SlurmJobInfo ] .
rdfs:domain hpc:hasVersionMicro [ hpc:SlurmJobInfo
